{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36690","headline":"湘中赠范郧 · 罗隐","name":"湘中赠范郧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹桂无心彼此谙，二年疎嬾共江潭。\n愁知酒醆终难舍，老觉人情转不堪。\n云外鸳鸯非故旧，眼前胶漆似烟岚。\n劳歌一曲霜风暮，击折湘妃白玉簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}